sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Service as Business service
    participant Broker as MQTT broker
    participant Device as Device

    Note over Device,Service: 1. Temperature exceeds the threshold
    Device->>Device: Read temperature and detect threshold exceedance
    Device->>Broker: Publish telemetry
    Broker->>Service: Deliver telemetry
    Service->>Service: Save message and update dashboard
    Device->>Broker: Publish alarm (if the minimum interval is met)
    Broker->>Service: Deliver alarm
    Service->>Service: Save alarm and update dashboard
    Service-->>Operator: Display alarm

    Note over Operator,Device: 2. Operator changes the interval
    Operator->>Service: device-1 SET_INTERVAL 1000
    Service->>Broker: Publish SET_INTERVAL 1000
    Broker->>Device: Deliver command
    Device->>Device: Set interval to 1000 ms
    Device->>Broker: Publish status: OK SET_INTERVAL 1000
    Broker->>Service: Deliver confirmation
    Service->>Service: Save message and update dashboard
    Service-->>Operator: Display confirmation
